OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy and cold start.
OL,6,FIsolated showers may affect the coast
OL,7,Fand Yorkshire Moors but most areas
OL,8,Fremain dry. Temperatures mostly below
OL,9,Faverage, away from the coast. Breezy
OL,10,Fin places.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear and dry evening and
OL,13,Fnight is expected for most areas
OL,14,Fallowing a widespread frost to
OL,15,Fdevelop. The odd mist and fog patch is
OL,16,Fpossible. Light winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA cold and clear start to
OL,19,Fthe day for most areas. Remaining cold
OL,20,Ffor most areas away from the coast
OL,21,Fdespite the sunshine. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
