OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FRemaining cold through Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday, but cloudier and with a slight
OL,8,Frisk of an isolated shower. Turning
OL,9,Fbreezier with potential for rain and
OL,10,Fhill snow on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
